{"path":"io/manip/uppercase","title":"std::uppercase, std::nouppercase","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>uppercase, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>nouppercase","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/manip/uppercase","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Enables the use of uppercase characters in floating-point and hexadecimal integer output. Has no effect on input.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ios\">&lt;ios&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> uppercase<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> nouppercase<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Enables the use of uppercase characters in floating-point and hexadecimal integer output. Has no effect on input.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Enables the <code>uppercase</code> flag in the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str.<span class=\"me1\">setf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1713\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Disables the <code>uppercase</code> flag in the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> as if by calling <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str.<span class=\"me1\">unsetf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1713\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<p>This is an I/O manipulator, it may be called with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span></span></code> for any <code>out</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> or with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span></span></code> for any <code>in</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\">std::basic_istream</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> str\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> reference to I/O stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code> (reference to the stream after manipulation).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/hex\"><span class=\"kw1797\">std::<span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/showbase\"><span class=\"kw1783\">std::<span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"0x2a with uppercase: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu12\">0x2a</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"0x2a with nouppercase: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">nouppercase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu12\">0x2a</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"1e-10 with uppercase: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu19\">1e-10</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"1e-10 with nouppercase: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">nouppercase</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu19\">1e-10</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0x2a with uppercase: 0X2A\n0x2a with nouppercase: 0x2a\n1e-10 with uppercase: 1E-10\n1e-10 with nouppercase: 1e-10</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/resetiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>resetiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  clears the specified ios_base flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the specified <code>ios_base</code> flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::uppercase, std::nouppercase","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Enables the use of uppercase characters in floating-point and hexadecimal integer output."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"str"},{"label":"Return value","note":"str (reference to the stream after manipulation)."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"resetiosflags","note":"clears the specified ios_base flags"},{"label":"setiosflags","note":"sets the specified ios_base flags"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":204,"codeBlockCount":2}
